    "name": {
      "value": "Menagerie Dung Sweeper"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Whether you washed warrior beasts below the Irorium's arena floor or tended to the mutated animals of a Puddle sideshow, you are experienced with all manner of weird wildlife.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Nature skill and the Animal Lore skill. You gain the Train Animal skill feat."
    },
